# The sdist carries what building the wheel needs: pyproject.toml, README.md,
# LICENSE and src/, whose resources [tool.setuptools.package-data] declares.
# setuptools would also add tests/test_*.py by default, but not the fixtures
# and fakes those need (tests/conftest.py, tests/fixtures/), so that copy
# could not run; the suite runs from a checkout (docs/development.md).
# tests/dist_check.py checks the sdist's file list.
prune tests
